  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44116532",
      "title": "Defer Loading Until Viewport Visibility",
      "lectureOrder": 309,
      "videoOrder": 293,
      "sourceHash": "c2f6cf43405a4d5abbb7fc451389bc208a902c8b1c4c9088d4dceccab78b4882",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.57,
          "end": 1.65,
          "en": "So the goal now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.65,
          "end": 6.65,
          "en": "is not to load the code that belongs to a route lazily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.26,
          "end": 10.8,
          "en": "Indeed, I have no routes in this basic site,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.8,
          "end": 13.92,
          "en": "but instead to load this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.92,
          "end": 16.17,
          "en": "and its related code lazily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.17,
          "end": 18.12,
          "en": "That's the goal now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.12,
          "end": 21.63,
          "en": "So how can we now use this deferrable views feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.63,
          "end": 25.8,
          "en": "to lazily load this app offer preview component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.8,
          "end": 27.393,
          "en": "and all the related code?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.44,
          "end": 33.183,
          "en": "Well, simply by adding @defer to your template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.08,
          "end": 35.85,
          "en": "and then by adding curly braces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.85,
          "end": 40.11,
          "en": "and wrapping that around the code you wanna load lazily,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.11,
          "end": 43.293,
          "en": "so around the component you wanna load lazily.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.03,
          "end": 48.6,
          "en": "By default, without any further configuration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.6,
          "end": 52.14,
          "en": "Angular would now go ahead and load this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.14,
          "end": 53.616,
          "en": "and its related code lazily",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.616,
          "end": 57.57,
          "en": "once the browser enters an idle state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.57,
          "end": 60.69,
          "en": "which in simplified terms, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.69,
          "end": 64.47,
          "en": "means that it's currently not performing some heavy task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.47,
          "end": 65.943,
          "en": "on your website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.26,
          "end": 71.78999999999999,
          "en": "But defer actually also allows you to add parentheses here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.78999999999999,
          "end": 74.13,
          "en": "and to find some conditions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.13,
          "end": 76.168,
          "en": "or add further configuration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.168,
          "end": 80.07300000000001,
          "en": "that configures when exactly that will be loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 81.66,
          "end": 84.66,
          "en": "For example, you can add a trigger here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.66,
          "end": 87.09,
          "en": "by adding the on keyword,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.09,
          "end": 89.73,
          "en": "and then thereafter the name of the trigger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.73,
          "end": 92.13,
          "en": "you wanna react to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.13,
          "end": 95.16,
          "en": "And as you can see on the official website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.16,
          "end": 96.9,
          "en": "in the official documentation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.9,
          "end": 100.68,
          "en": "there are a couple of triggers you could use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.68,
          "end": 103.62,
          "en": "For example, on viewport,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.62,
          "end": 105.69,
          "en": "this trigger would make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.69,
          "end": 108.102,
          "en": "that this component is only loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.102,
          "end": 111.39,
          "en": "if it's scrolled into the viewport,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.39,
          "end": 113.82300000000001,
          "en": "so if the user can actually see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.17,
          "end": 117.267,
          "en": "Though, as you see, if you hover over viewport,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.267,
          "end": 121.32,
          "en": "this actually requires a placeholder block,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.32,
          "end": 124.35,
          "en": "which is another feature offered by defer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.35,
          "end": 127.92,
          "en": "You can also add a placeholder to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.92,
          "end": 131.518,
          "en": "to define some fallback content that will be shown",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.518,
          "end": 135.453,
          "en": "whilst this content here is not loaded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.51,
          "end": 142.323,
          "en": "like a paragraph that says we might have an offer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.61,
          "end": 146.1,
          "en": "So this will now be shown initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.1,
          "end": 149.1,
          "en": "or will be rendered initially, I should say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 152.13,
          "en": "since technically, the user likely will never see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.13,
          "end": 153.99,
          "en": "But this will be rendered initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.99,
          "end": 157.74,
          "en": "But once this is scrolled into the viewport,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.74,
          "end": 160.41,
          "en": "it will be replaced with this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.41,
          "end": 163.59300000000002,
          "en": "that is now loaded lazily on demand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.3,
          "end": 167.31,
          "en": "With that, if you save that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.31,
          "end": 169.92000000000002,
          "en": "If you go back and you reload this website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.92000000000002,
          "end": 172.5,
          "en": "and you then wait for a couple of seconds",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 175.71,
          "en": "so that in theory, that timer of the offer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.71,
          "end": 179.31,
          "en": "would already tick down a couple of seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 179.31,
          "end": 183.27,
          "en": "If you do all that and you then scroll down, huh,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.27,
          "end": 186,
          "en": "you see it looks like the timer just started,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 186,
          "end": 188.905,
          "en": "which proves that this entire component down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 188.905,
          "end": 191.94,
          "en": "was only just loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.94,
          "end": 194.13,
          "en": "And you can also see that that's the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 194.13,
          "end": 198.21,
          "en": "if you reload again and you open your developer tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.21,
          "end": 201.81,
          "en": "and you go to the network tab and you then scroll down,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.81,
          "end": 206.43,
          "en": "because you should see some code chunks being loaded here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 206.43,
          "end": 207.9,
          "en": "And if you inspect them, you'll see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.9,
          "end": 211.941,
          "en": "that there's quite a bit of code that is being loaded here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 211.941,
          "end": 215.433,
          "en": "when this component is loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 216.39,
          "end": 219.42000000000002,
          "en": "And that also proves that lazy loading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 219.42000000000002,
          "end": 222.6,
          "en": "with @defer works here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.6,
          "end": 225.513,
          "en": "in this case with help of the viewport trigger.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
